    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547730/extras/166b859d3e8d4906186dbc2abd4109a9.poster.avif?t=1752431110\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547730/extras/166b859d3e8d4906186dbc2abd4109a9.apng?t=1752431110\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>Xanguito Aventura is a small, tributary 2D platformer inspired by classics of the past.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547730/extras/c6e0283bba5884377c8f313d2c465582.poster.avif?t=1752431110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547730/extras/c6e0283bba5884377c8f313d2c465582.webm?t=1752431110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>In the  30+ levels you will:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>jump and double-jump your way through obstacles and enemies.<br></li><li>discover multiple collectibles.<br></li><li>make use of several power-ups.<br></li><li>survive challenging dungeons.<br></li><li>unlock hidden challenges.<br></li><li>overcome unique bosses.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547730/extras/7d9e90de2ba4ac21d07513bad421cfe3.poster.avif?t=1752431110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547730/extras/7d9e90de2ba4ac21d07513bad421cfe3.webm?t=1752431110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Join Xanguito on his difficult but fair adventure through nostalgic memories.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547730/extras/166b859d3e8d4906186dbc2abd4109a9.poster.avif?t=1752431110\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547730/extras/166b859d3e8d4906186dbc2abd4109a9.apng?t=1752431110\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>Xanguito Aventura is a small, tributary 2D platformer inspired by classics of the past.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547730/extras/c6e0283bba5884377c8f313d2c465582.poster.avif?t=1752431110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547730/extras/c6e0283bba5884377c8f313d2c465582.webm?t=1752431110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>In the  30+ levels you will:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>jump and double-jump your way through obstacles and enemies.<br></li><li>discover multiple collectibles.<br></li><li>make use of several power-ups.<br></li><li>survive challenging dungeons.<br></li><li>unlock hidden challenges.<br></li><li>overcome unique bosses.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547730/extras/7d9e90de2ba4ac21d07513bad421cfe3.poster.avif?t=1752431110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1547730/extras/7d9e90de2ba4ac21d07513bad421cfe3.webm?t=1752431110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Join Xanguito on his difficult but fair adventure through nostalgic memories.",
